uote's returned we may  actually want to do some error handling  to determine if there's any issues with  the quote so let's go ahead and log  quote information and then  check to see if the quote has any error  codes  if there is an error code we may want to  return  an error status to be able to better  debug  we're able to pass through properties  from the quote as well  to the error once our error handling and  logging is in place  if we publish this will make our site  changes productive  with our production site up and ready to  go let's go ahead and enable the logging  back on our wix site dashboard when we  go to settings  production tools site monitoring we're  able to easily connect  to the google cloud operations logging  tools  when we connect we just connect with our  google single sign-on account  and we're able to get to the dashboard  once we're in the google cloud dashboard  we're able to look at the logs  for our site so let's take a look at  what a user's flow may look like and how  we can do some error handling  back in my wix editor i'm going to go to  view site  and on my site i'm going to go through a  user flow of trying to book a vacation  let's take a look at the properties that  are available and select one that looks  like a nice vacation home  once i'm on the vacation properties page  i'm able to play around with the quote  information  and see how changing my requested dates  will change  my quote information we can go through  trying to book this site as well  i now will try to place my booking  as a user if i run into any issues i can  process information back along to the  agency and see if they can help me  figure out what's going on  as a developer to make sure that your  site is healthy if we take a look back  at our logs  we're able to retrieve if there is any  information and find any errors  i can filter down for my errors see that  there was an issue with a quote  retrieval  and determined what went wrong by taking  a look at 